    "id": "hyperbola_standard_form",
    "content": "双曲线标准方程：以原点为中心，实轴在x轴时为 x²/a² - y²/b² = 1（a>0,b>0），实轴在y轴时为 y²/a² - x²/b² = 1。其中 c² = a² + b²，e = c/a > 1。",
    "latex_formula": "\\frac{x^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1,\\quad c^2=a^2+b^2,\\quad e=\\frac{c}{a}>1",
    "topic": "hyperbola",
    "subtopic": "standard_form",
    "difficulty_range": [1, 2]
  },
  {
    "id": "hyperbola_asymptotes",
    "content": "双曲线渐近线：x²/a² - y²/b² = 1 的渐近线为 y = ±(b/a)x，即 bx ± ay = 0。渐近线过原点，双曲线无限趋近但不相交渐近线。",
    "latex_formula": "y=\\pm\\frac{b}{a}x,\\quad bx\\pm ay=0",
    "topic": "hyperbola",
    "subtopic": "asymptotes",
    "difficulty_range": [2, 3]
  },
